@page "/operate/resources/import/task"

<PageTitle>Dataset import · Honua Console</PageTitle>
<section class="console-page" data-dataset-import-panel>
    <h1>Import dataset</h1>
    <p>Contribute the original file to the import task in this conversation.</p>
    <p role="status" aria-live="polite" data-import-status>Checking the current task…</p>
    <dl>
        <dt>Destination</dt><dd data-import-destination>Not bound</dd>
        <dt>Source</dt><dd data-import-source>Not bound</dd>
    </dl>
    <div class="console-form-grid">
        <label for="dataset-import-file">Original dataset file</label>
        <input id="dataset-import-file" type="file" data-import-file disabled />
        <progress data-import-progress max="1" value="0" aria-label="File transfer progress"></progress>
        <div class="console-button-row">
            <button type="button" data-import-check disabled>Check complete file</button>
            <button type="button" data-import-clear disabled>Clear selected file</button>
            <button type="button" data-import-transfer disabled>Upload and verify</button>
            <button type="button" data-import-submit disabled>Prepare import for agent</button>
            <button type="button" data-import-recover disabled>Check original status</button>
            <button type="button" data-import-pause disabled>Pause</button>
            <button type="button" data-import-cancel disabled>Cancel upload</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p>The file is checked in bounded chunks. A retained source is separate from an accepted import job.</p>
</section>
